                "text": "<p><br/>They say diamonds are forever. But at Tishva, we believe diamonds should also be<br/>for everyone.<br/>Gone are the days when diamonds were reserved only for special occasions and<br/>locked away in safes. Why wait for a lifetime to shine? At Tishva, we’re here to<br/>change the rules and how you look at diamonds.<br/>We bring you lab-grown diamonds—real and responsibly made—at prices that<br/>don’t make your heart skip a beat. Our diamonds aren’t pulled from deep within the<br/>earth; they’re grown with science, love, and care, making them just as brilliant as<br/>mined diamonds but far more sustainable and affordable.<br/>Whether you’re buying your first diamond, celebrating a milestone, or simply want to<br/>add a little sparkle to your everyday life, Tishva is here to make diamonds effortless,<br/>affordable, and sustainable.<br/>With premium craftsmanship and modern designs, Tishva makes diamond for every<br/>mood, every moment, and every YOU.<br/>Because at Tishva, everyone deserves to shine. ✨</p>",
